{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TowerDef</strong> is an exhilarating tower defense game that blends timeless strategy gameplay with innovative twists. Step into the shoes of the commander and take charge of the battlefield \u2014 your mission is to protect your base from endless waves of increasingly formidable enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock &amp; Upgrade</strong>: Build a powerful defense by unlocking and upgrading a diverse roster of towers, each with distinct abilities and roles \u2014 from rapid-fire cannons to elemental magic towers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic Depth</strong>: Position your towers wisely and adapt your tactics on the fly as enemy types evolve and new threats emerge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Levels</strong>: Battle through a variety of environments, each with unique layouts and challenges that will test your planning skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to defend the last line? The fate of the battlefield lies in your hands!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756880?t=1749660917","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756880?t=1749660917","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756880/a96246ba55f8e0acb83772f572e3654ef6d752c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749660917","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756880/a96246ba55f8e0acb83772f572e3654ef6d752c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749660917","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TowerDef</strong> is an exhilarating tower defense game that blends timeless strategy gameplay with innovative twists. Step into the shoes of the commander and take charge of the battlefield \u2014 your mission is to protect your base from endless waves of increasingly formidable enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock &amp; Upgrade</strong>: Build a powerful defense by unlocking and upgrading a diverse roster of towers, each with distinct abilities and roles \u2014 from rapid-fire cannons to elemental magic towers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic Depth</strong>: Position your towers wisely and adapt your tactics on the fly as enemy types evolve and new threats emerge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Levels</strong>: Battle through a variety of environments, each with unique layouts and challenges that will test your planning skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to defend the last line? The fate of the battlefield lies in your hands!</p>","developers":["me"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756880/c13bdc921b0fc14eb82d42b4c6dc87f5d7a490d3/header.jpg?t=1749660917","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257143131,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143131/movie480.mp4?t=1748485573","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143131/movie_max.mp4?t=1748485573"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257143131/5e098517380bcc5ff201ee139f0c862609757313/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748485573","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143131/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748485573","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143131/movie_ma